# ⚽ GRUDGE AGENT — FIFA World Cup 2026

> A savage AI prediction tracker that roasts your bad calls and holds grudges across sessions. Powered by Claude AI + Walrus decentralized storage.

![GRUDGE AGENT](https://img.shields.io/badge/World%20Cup-2026-ff6b35?style=for-the-badge)
![Walrus](https://img.shields.io/badge/Walrus-Testnet-00c853?style=for-the-badge)
