## 🎯 What It Does

- **Predict match outcomes** across all FIFA World Cup 2026 teams
- **Get roasted by GRUDGE** — an AI agent that mocks every questionable pick
- **Persistent memory** — GRUDGE remembers your failures across sessions via Walrus blob storage
- **Grudge File** — a running ledger of your worst calls, brought up whenever relevant
- **Grudge Meter** — a visual gauge of how badly you've been predicting
- **Walrus Blob IDs** — every save creates a verifiable, public blob on Walrus Testnet

