## 🚀 Quick Start

### 1. Clone & Install

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/grudge-agent-wc2026.git
cd grudge-agent-wc2026
npm install
```

### 2. Set Up Environment

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

Open `.env` and add your Anthropic API key:

```
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
```

Get your key at: https://console.anthropic.com

### 3. Run Locally

```bash
npm run dev
```

Open http://localhost:3000

