## 📦 Deploy to Vercel (Recommended)

### Option A: One-Click via Vercel CLI

```bash
npm install -g vercel
vercel
```

Follow the prompts. When asked about environment variables, add `VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`.

### Option B: Via Vercel Dashboard

1. Push this repo to GitHub
2. Go to https://vercel.com/new
3. Import your repository
4. Add environment variable: `VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`
5. Click **Deploy**

### Option C: Deploy to Netlify

```bash
npm run build
# Drag the `dist/` folder to https://app.netlify.com/drop
```

Or connect GitHub repo at https://app.netlify.com/start

