## 🦭 Walrus Integration

This app uses **Walrus Testnet** for decentralized persistent memory.

### How It Works

1. Make predictions and get roasted
2. Click **"Save to Walrus Testnet"** in the Memory tab
3. A **Blob ID** is returned and displayed
4. Share the Blob ID — anyone can restore your full prediction history + grudge file
5. Paste a Blob ID in **"Restore Memory"** to reload a saved state

### Blob ID Format

```
BlobID: AbCdEfGh1234...  (base58-encoded, ~44 chars)
View at: https://aggregator.walrus-testnet.walrus.space/v1/blobs/{blobId}
```

### Switching to Mainnet

In `.env`, replace:
```
VITE_WALRUS_PUBLISHER=https://publisher.walrus.space
VITE_WALRUS_AGGREGATOR=https://aggregator.walrus.space
```

> ⚠️ Mainnet requires WAL tokens for storage fees.

